                        "entry_id": "3273b73f-41a0-33a8-839e-5d50df606a12",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The quality of being awesome."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "275a840d-b4b7-40cc-9d84-6a70b42c2a47",
                                "sense_id": "01fbc6f8-9955-3c41-98b5-ad0fd0869058",
                                "text": "Traditional religions try to capture the awesomeness and subdue the terror with their sense of fate, as did Nietzsche. We should not deny that such notions are naturalistic just because they are also religious."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d835b33-71f5-4495-aacf-5d3378ade7c1",
                                "sense_id": "01fbc6f8-9955-3c41-98b5-ad0fd0869058",
                                "text": "The bogan likes playing Epic Leads because the bogan is on an inexorable quest for maxtreme awesomeness."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
